potension; correction.","ozarotasir":["Increases cardiac glycoside toxicity (hypokalaemia)","Raises lithium levels","NSAIDs reduce the effect"],"qollash":{"kattalar":"12.5–25 mg/day (hypertension), up to 50 mg (oedema); morning.","bolalar":"1–2 mg/kg/day"},"chiqarish":"Tablets 25, 50, 100 mg"}}